# What `vercel deploy` (remote build, ci.yml) must not upload. Vercel already skips .git,
# node_modules, .next and .vercel. Keep src, scripts, drizzle, e2e and tests: next build
# type-checks every file tsconfig.json includes.
# Folder patterns are anchored to the repo root with a leading "/": an unanchored `tasks/` also
# matched src/modules/tasks/ and broke the production build (2026-10-02).
.env*
!.env.example
*.pem
/.claude/
/.agents/
/.github/
/docs/
/tasks/
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
/e2e/.auth/
/exports/
/.pgdata/
